    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In an initiative to combat one of the world's deadliest diseases, the Directorate of Malarial Control (DoMC) and the Aga Khan University's Malaria Elimination Consortium (AKU-MEC), the Ministry for Health, Sindh, the department for Vector Borne Diseases and Zenysis Technologies have joined hands to spearhead Pakistan's mission to eliminate malaria by 2035.",
